      "id": "claim-f3628eb43a6a42414560",
      "sourceIds": [
        "forecasts-ad28a606f0881dfe7cfc"
      ],
      "text": "Forecasts.consume is the source-declared listener for weather.place-requested; the handler parses and validates each record, then follows the separately accepted Forecasts.consume operation for rejection, inbox, upsert, refresh, and acknowledgment details. This overview links forecasts-refresh-scheduled and forecasts-publish-pending as related views. The saved process definition says those links establish neither cross-process order, shared transaction atomicity, acknowledgment timing, nor delivery. The process scope includes Forecasts only; Spring listener activation and runtime delivery remain unverified."
    },
    "title": "Forecasts place-requested process overview"
  },
